dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135317672,imgsize-650132.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Double loss of double engine': Akhilesh mocks BJP over UP MLC poll results]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/double-loss-of-double-engine-akhilesh-mocks-bjp-over-up-mlc-poll-results/articleshow/135317352.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135317352.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Akhilesh Yadav criticized the BJP following their loss in the Uttar Pradesh Legislative Council elections held recently. He attributed the victory to teachers and young voters while alleging electoral manipulation by the BJP. The Samajwadi Party leader believes this defeat sets the foundation for the upcoming 2027 assembly elections. Yadav emphasized unity among marginalized communities and expressed gratitude towards supporters for their vigilance during the counting process.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/double-loss-of-double-engine-akhilesh-mocks-bjp-over-up-mlc-poll-results/articleshow/135317352.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/double-loss-of-double-engine-akhilesh-mocks-bjp-over-up-mlc-poll-results/articleshow/135317352.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T18:57:19+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135317465,imgsize-154604.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Evening newswrap: Pakistani lawmaker mocks Khawaja Asif after Munir’s Iran visit; SC wonders what's 'wrong' with victims of digital arrest &amp; more]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-newswrap-pakistani-lawmaker-mocks-khawaja-asif-after-munirs-iran-visit-sc-wonders-whats-wrong-with-victims-of-digital-arrest-more/articleshow/135314210.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135314210.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-newswrap-pakistani-lawmaker-mocks-khawaja-asif-after-munirs-iran-visit-sc-wonders-whats-wrong-with-victims-of-digital-arrest-more/articleshow/135314210.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-newswrap-pakistani-lawmaker-mocks-khawaja-asif-after-munirs-iran-visit-sc-wonders-whats-wrong-with-victims-of-digital-arrest-more/articleshow/135314210.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T18:28:59+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135315055,imgsize-1106695.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[India-EU landmark FTA likely rollout in mid-2027, says top EU lawmaker]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-eu-landmark-fta-likely-rollout-in-mid-2027-says-top-eu-lawmaker/articleshow/135312821.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135312821.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-eu-landmark-fta-likely-rollout-in-mid-2027-says-top-eu-lawmaker/articleshow/135312821.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-eu-landmark-fta-likely-rollout-in-mid-2027-says-top-eu-lawmaker/articleshow/135312821.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T18:14:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sachin Parashar</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135313164,imgsize-599425.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[It only takes one rumour: How a small trigger can lead to a deadly stampede]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/it-only-takes-one-rumour-how-a-small-trigger-can-lead-to-a-deadly-stampede/articleshow/135302224.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135302224.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[On October 17, a tragic stampede in Kolkata claimed 19 lives during the Durga Puja celebrations. The incident was caused by overcrowding, panic, and a misleading announcement about structural failure. Experts emphasize the importance of effective crowd management to prevent similar tragedies in the future. Investigators are examining various factors contributing to the disaster, including narrow exits and inadequate safety measures.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/it-only-takes-one-rumour-how-a-small-trigger-can-lead-to-a-deadly-stampede/articleshow/135302224.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/it-only-takes-one-rumour-how-a-small-trigger-can-lead-to-a-deadly-stampede/articleshow/135302224.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T16:30:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135302559,imgsize-192876.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['What is wrong with victims': CJI on digital arrest cases; calls for compensation from banks]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/act-as-protective-umbrella-sc-says-banks-must-compensate-digital-fraud-victims/articleshow/135301419.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135301419.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/act-as-protective-umbrella-sc-says-banks-must-compensate-digital-fraud-victims/articleshow/135301419.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/act-as-protective-umbrella-sc-says-banks-must-compensate-digital-fraud-victims/articleshow/135301419.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T15:53:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135301471,imgsize-191442.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[SC disposes of Mahua Moitra's plea seeking public disclosure of AIF, FPI beneficiaries]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sc-disposes-of-mahua-moitras-plea-seeking-public-disclosure-of-aif-fpi-beneficiaries/articleshow/135297250.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135297250.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sc-disposes-of-mahua-moitras-plea-seeking-public-disclosure-of-aif-fpi-beneficiaries/articleshow/135297250.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sc-disposes-of-mahua-moitras-plea-seeking-public-disclosure-of-aif-fpi-beneficiaries/articleshow/135297250.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T15:47:59+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Ayush Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135301282,imgsize-103854.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[From Hitler’s rise to farmers’ misery in India: How the Great Depression changed lives far beyond America]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/from-hitlers-rise-to-farmers-misery-in-india-how-the-great-depression-changed-lives-far-beyond-america/articleshow/135300062.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135300062.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The October 1929 stock market crash in the United States ignited a global economic disaster that resulted in widespread unemployment and business closures. In Germany and India, the crisis led to heightened political unrest and movements for independence. Falling agricultural prices devastated Indian farmers, pushing them closer to revolution against British oppression. Meanwhile, Britain faced significant industrial downturns and job losses, highlighting the urgent need for international economic collaboration.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/from-hitlers-rise-to-farmers-misery-in-india-how-the-great-depression-changed-lives-far-beyond-america/articleshow/135300062.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/from-hitlers-rise-to-farmers-misery-in-india-how-the-great-depression-changed-lives-far-beyond-america/articleshow/135300062.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T15:29:22+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aryan Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135300476,imgsize-316570.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[MLC election results: BJP wins big, but Congress and Samajwadi Party send a message from Nagpur, Varanasi]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mlc-election-results-bjp-wins-big-but-congress-and-samajwadi-party-send-a-message-from-nagpur-varanasi/articleshow/135298231.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135298231.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[While the BJP-led NDA won big in the MLC elections across four states, it suffered setbacks in two politically significant constituencies: Nagpur and Varanasi where the Congress and SP held their ground.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mlc-election-results-bjp-wins-big-but-congress-and-samajwadi-party-send-a-message-from-nagpur-varanasi/articleshow/135298231.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mlc-election-results-bjp-wins-big-but-congress-and-samajwadi-party-send-a-message-from-nagpur-varanasi/articleshow/135298231.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T15:21:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Priyanka Mukherjee</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135299191,imgsize-2052232.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Ballot paper, still we ask': Kharge dares BJP to dissolve Parliament after MLC poll setback]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ballot-paper-still-we-ask-kharge-dares-bjp-to-dissolve-parliament-after-mlc-poll-setback/articleshow/135298079.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135298079.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ballot-paper-still-we-ask-kharge-dares-bjp-to-dissolve-parliament-after-mlc-poll-setback/articleshow/135298079.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ballot-paper-still-we-ask-kharge-dares-bjp-to-dissolve-parliament-after-mlc-poll-setback/articleshow/135298079.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T14:20:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135298145,imgsize-1202334.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Vote chori' row: INDIA bloc to hold 'mock Parliament' to 'impeach' CEC Gyanesh Kumar; mega rally on Nov 1]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/vote-chori-row-india-bloc-to-hold-mock-parliament-to-impeach-cec-gyanesh-kumar-mega-rally-on-nov-1/articleshow/135297284.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135297284.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/vote-chori-row-india-bloc-to-hold-mock-parliament-to-impeach-cec-gyanesh-kumar-mega-rally-on-nov-1/articleshow/135297284.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/vote-chori-row-india-bloc-to-hold-mock-parliament-to-impeach-cec-gyanesh-kumar-mega-rally-on-nov-1/articleshow/135297284.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T14:13:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Priyanka Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135297948,imgsize-91528.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A vitamin clue to stroke in the young? Bengaluru study finds low B6 levels]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/a-vitamin-clue-to-stroke-in-the-young-bengaluru-study-finds-low-b6-levels/articleshow/135296468.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135296468.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[A recent study from Bengaluru finds lower levels of vitamin B6 in young adults with ischaemic strokes compared to healthy individuals. This study involved comparing vitamin B6 levels in 171 stroke patients and 249 healthy controls. Researchers found that vitamin B6 insufficiency was more prevalent among stroke patients than in the control group. Although vitamin B6 is linked to stroke risk, further research is essential to understand the implications.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/a-vitamin-clue-to-stroke-in-the-young-bengaluru-study-finds-low-b6-levels/articleshow/135296468.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/a-vitamin-clue-to-stroke-in-the-young-bengaluru-study-finds-low-b6-levels/articleshow/135296468.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T13:31:40+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Anuja Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135296468,imgsize-63410.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Congress calls Rahul Gandhi's 'Sitarama' misspelling in Tata post 'typo marketing', mocks BJP]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/congress-calls-rahul-gandhis-sitharama-misspelling-in-tata-post-typo-marketing-mocks-bjp/articleshow/135295965.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135295965.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/congress-calls-rahul-gandhis-sitharama-misspelling-in-tata-post-typo-marketing-mocks-bjp/articleshow/135295965.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/congress-calls-rahul-gandhis-sitharama-misspelling-in-tata-post-typo-marketing-mocks-bjp/articleshow/135295965.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T13:15:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135296119,imgsize-1195961.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Thousands of years of knowledge, struggle shaped India as cultural nation: Gajendra Singh Shekhawat]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/thousands-of-years-of-knowledge-struggle-shaped-india-as-cultural-nation-shekhawat/articleshow/135295818.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135295818.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[At the launch of 'Timeless India' held at Dharohar Bhawan, Union Culture Minister Gajendra Singh Shekhawat passionately articulated the essence of India's cultural heritage, which has been shaped through centuries of learning and trials. This book is a clarion call for the preservation of our historical sites and a deeper understanding of our cultural narrative.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/thousands-of-years-of-knowledge-struggle-shaped-india-as-cultural-nation-shekhawat/articleshow/135295818.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/thousands-of-years-of-knowledge-struggle-shaped-india-as-cultural-nation-shekhawat/articleshow/135295818.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T13:13:10+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135296037,imgsize-33528.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Forces fortify key Arunachal bridge to fight dam objectors]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/forces-fortify-key-arunachal-bridge-to-fight-dam-objectors/articleshow/135293686.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135293686.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Protests against the dam at the Dite-Dime bridge have prompted a strong response from law enforcement. The Central Armed Police Forces have been deployed to ensure order in the affected districts. Recent confrontations during a bandh left several people injured, including four women, escalating tensions. As supporters clashed with security, the Dite-Dime bridge emerges as a focal point of strife near the India-China border.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/forces-fortify-key-arunachal-bridge-to-fight-dam-objectors/articleshow/135293686.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/forces-fortify-key-arunachal-bridge-to-fight-dam-objectors/articleshow/135293686.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T12:23:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Kangkan Kalita</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135293705,imgsize-1919041.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Cyclone Arnab: Amit Shah speaks to four CMs, says relief operations on 'war footing']]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cyclone-arnab-amit-shah-speaks-to-four-cms-says-relief-operations-on-war-footing/articleshow/135292453.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135292453.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Amidst the aftermath of Cyclone Arnab, Union home minister Amit Shah coordinated efforts with chief ministers of the impacted states, pledging essential assistance to alleviate the disaster's effects. With nine fatalities reported in Andhra Pradesh, evacuations were necessary, and significant crop damage affected about 2 lakh hectares. Restoration work is underway, with unwavering support from the central government for the affected regions.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cyclone-arnab-amit-shah-speaks-to-four-cms-says-relief-operations-on-war-footing/articleshow/135292453.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cyclone-arnab-amit-shah-speaks-to-four-cms-says-relief-operations-on-war-footing/articleshow/135292453.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T11:56:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135293425,imgsize-76462.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Don't worry about lathis': Rahul calls on people to join INDIA bloc's 'Delhi chalo' march]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dont-worry-about-lathis-rahul-calls-on-people-to-join-india-blocs-delhi-chalo-march/articleshow/135292996.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135292996.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Rahul Gandhi invited everyone to partake in the upcoming Chalo Delhi march at Ramlila Maidan. This initiative seeks to challenge purported electoral malfeasance and uphold democratic integrity. He stated the march embodies the nation’s collective desire and is open to all political groups. Student bodies from throughout the political spectrum are encouraged to join. The Congress party plans a significant opposition rally on November 1.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dont-worry-about-lathis-rahul-calls-on-people-to-join-india-blocs-delhi-chalo-march/articleshow/135292996.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dont-worry-about-lathis-rahul-calls-on-people-to-join-india-blocs-delhi-chalo-march/articleshow/135292996.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-29T11:38:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135293030,imgsize-93886.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Raids to produce reels’: Ex TN CM Stalin cries foul over Vijay govt searching KN Nehru-linked premises]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/raids-to-produce-reels-ex-tn-cm-stalin-cries-foul-over-vijay-govt-searching-kn-nehru-linked-premises/articleshow/135292135.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135292135.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/raids-to-produce-reels-ex-tn-cm-stalin-cries-foul-over-vijay-govt-searching-kn-nehru-linked-premises/articleshow/135292135.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/raids-to-produce-r